Setup and run
-------------

Use the project virtual environment so the dependencies in `requirements.txt`
are available:

	.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
	python create_db.py
	python main.py

Run `create_db.py` again whenever `documents/DBMS.txt` changes. If `main.py`
reports that the Chroma database is empty, rebuild it with that command.

Retrivers 

by data source - external data (api keys) 

1) why retrivers to find the exact match as i have similarity search - because similarity search in vedtordb is not runnable 
so not used in chain and aslo retrivers uses various technique to find the similar things 

2) search strategies 
cosine similarity - vectordb 
MMR - maximum marginal relevance    (only found in retrivers)   
suppose you have three to four sentence repaeting the same thing , so we used this to have the diverse result
Multi query retrivers - suppose you say what is gradient discent 
then we dont have much context of the ques , so to create diverse way of asking the same question we used it 
here we use retrivers as similarity or mmr and llm for diverse question generation